    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not talking about real life, i'm talking about this. being stuck in this room while the world ends. you're supposed to be my companion in this story, aren't you? just tell me the truth... if everything is already lost, isn't it better to go out on your own terms than to just wait for the fire to reach the door?",
